    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "King Auctioneers are delighted to bring this Super Family Home to the market.\r\nThis wonderful property, situated in the ever popular estate of Rahanine Manor has it all!\r\nExcellent decor, Sun Lounge, Attic conversion to Home Office, Solar Panels, EV Charger and a B energy Rating.\r\n\r\nIn walk in condition, within walking distance of local Primary and Secondary Schools, minutes from the M6 motorway.\r\n\r\nOpen viewing Thursday 13th August at 7pm."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\t\t\t4.83m x 1.77m with tiled floor.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C:\t\t\t1.60m x 0.77m with W.C., &  Wash Hand Basin. Fully tiled.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner:\t\t\t5.56m x 3.75m with fitted units & tiled floor.\r\n\r\nSun Lounge:\t\t\t3.28m x 2.43m with tiled floor.\r\n\r\nT.V. Lounge:\t\t\t4.83m x 3.00m with  fitted units, & Stove with back boiler. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nMaster Bedroom:\t\t3.81m x 3.36m with Walk-In Wardrobe 2m x 1m.\r\n\r\nEnsuite:\t\t\t       1.99m 1.66m with W.C., Wash Hand Basin, & Shower.\r\n\r\nDouble Bedroom:\t\t3.17m x2.95m with open shelving.\r\n\r\nDouble Bedroom:\t\t2.99m x 2.50m with fitted wardrobes & work station.\r\n\r\nBathroom:\t\t\t2.12m x 2.04m with W.C., Wash Hand Basin, Bath & Shower.     \r\n\r\nSecond Floor:   \r\nOffice/Storage:\t\t3.56m x 3.47m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent Decor\r\nB Energy Rating\r\nSolar Pv System \r\nEv Charger\r\nAttic conversion"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Open Viewing Thursday 13th August at 7pm"
      }
